[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1378940249","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780#issuecomment-1378940249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780","id":1378940249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85SMPVZ","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-11T15:24:15Z","updated_at":"2023-01-11T15:24:15Z","body":"One of the nondefinitive factors in the inclusion principles is:\r\n\r\n> The license has actual, substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered. Substantial use may be demonstrated via use in many projects, or in one or a few significant projects. For new licenses, there are definitive plans for the license to be used in one or a few significant projects.\r\n\r\nCan you explain how, if at all, this criterion is met? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1378940249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1379244222","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780#issuecomment-1379244222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780","id":1379244222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85SNZi-","user":{"login":"mrj","id":111995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTk5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj","html_url":"https://github.com/mrj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-11T17:34:07Z","updated_at":"2023-01-11T17:34:07Z","body":"Thank you Richard for your question.\r\n\r\nMy argument would be that the usefulness and uniqueness of the DevWheels Licence makes it as worthwhile as some of the 545 licences in SPDX's latest release. I don't know how many users the least popular of these has, but one of my releases with this licence has over 50,000.\r\n\r\nThe reason I made this submission is so that I can release a RubyGem without having to state a [licence-ID](https://guides.rubygems.org/specification-reference/#license=) of \"Nonstandard\", although RubyGems recently allowed their licence-ID to link to a file rather than be an SPDX ID.\r\n\r\nAnd I suppose it's a bit like the Catch-22 of a young person having trouble getting a job because they lack experience. A standard licence is easier and more attractive to employ. I would like to advocate for my licence. This is a start.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1379244222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405216307","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780#issuecomment-1405216307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780","id":1405216307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85TweYz","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-26T15:51:49Z","updated_at":"2023-01-26T15:51:49Z","body":"@mrj [The purpose of the SPDX License List](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/faq.md#what-is-the-spdx-license-list) is to be \"a list of commonly found licenses and exceptions used in free and open or collaborative software, data, hardware, or documentation.\"\r\n\r\nFor brand new licenses for which there is little or no evidence of current usage, you are welcome to seek to encourage others to use your license and to get broad adoption. But the purpose of the SPDX License List is to reflect commonly- or broadly-used licenses in open collaborative development, not as a promotional list of newly-drafted licenses that do not have such usage.\r\n\r\nI'm not in favor of adding the license at this time. You are of course welcome to resubmit the license for consideration at some point in the future if you have seen significantly broader community uptake of it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405216307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1418759607","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780#issuecomment-1418759607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1780","id":1418759607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85UkI23","user":{"login":"mrj","id":111995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTk5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj","html_url":"https://github.com/mrj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-06T09:19:13Z","updated_at":"2023-02-06T09:19:13Z","body":"OK, thank you.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1418759607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]